    <p><strong>My Contributions</strong></p>
    <ul class="clean">
      <li><strong>Backend Integration:</strong> I integrated the <span class="metric">SANA 0.6B</span> and <span class="metric">Infinity-2B</span> model backends into our unified research pipeline so the team could evaluate persistence across diverse architectures.</li>
      <li><strong>Code Refactoring:</strong> I merged and refactored original E-value implementations from the literature, fixing compatibility issues and silent failures so the pipeline remained stable for large-scale experiments.</li>
      <li><strong>Improving Stability:</strong> I helped transition our detection framework from P-values to <span class="metric">E-values</span> to address instability issues during black-box detection.</li>
    </ul>

